{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"33cff204-605f-4fe0-9bba-cd21146e80c2","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the necessary fixes to the Intervals.icu OAuth integration and documented the root causes and applied fixes.\n\nYou can review the detailed explanation and summary in the generated artifact:\n\n**[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/33cff204-605f-4fe0-9bba-cd21146e80c2/ANSWER.md)**\n\nKey actions performed:\n- Updated scopes to avoid duplicate entries.\n- Modified the init endpoint to require POST and return the authorization URL as JSON.\n- Adjusted the frontend to use a button with a POST request for initiating the OAuth flow.\n- Simplified the token exchange payload to match Intervals.icu’s expectations.\n- Added comprehensive documentation of the issues and fixes.\n","duration_seconds":217.444059,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":45381,"output_tokens":17655,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":679296,"total_tokens":63036}}}
